---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
        title="About Junk Force 1 in Jacksonville"
        description="Why we focus on making local junk removal simple, transparent, and stress-free."
        pubDate={new Date('February 12 2025')}
        heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
        <p>
                Junk Force 1 was founded to give Jacksonville homeowners, renters, and business owners a reliable way to clear out
                clutter without the headaches of renting trucks or guessing what a pickup might cost. Our crews live and work
                throughout Duval County, which means we navigate local traffic, HOA rules, and loading quirks efficiently.
        </p>

        <p>
                Every visit includes a firm, volume-based quote before loading begins. Once approved, the team handles all lifting,
                loading, and sweep-up so you can get back to your day. We prioritize donations and recycling whenever possible to
                keep reusable items out of landfills and support community organizations.
        </p>

        <p>
                Whether you are preparing a home for market, refreshing a rental between tenants, or finally tackling that garage
                cleanout, we are here to help. Reach out to schedule a pickup or learn more about how we can tailor a plan to your
                property.
        </p>
</Layout>
